<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-D. Jones sees CEO announcement soon.</title>
<headline>RTRS-D. Jones sees CEO announcement soon.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department store retailer David Jones Ltd said on Wednesday an announcement about a new chief executive officer to replace Chris Tideman would be announced within days.</p>
<p>&quot;We expect to make an announcement within days, not weeks,&quot; chairman Richard Warburton told reporters.</p>
<p>The company announced on Monday that Tideman, who joined the company in 1994, had resigned, effective immediately, citing personal reason.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
